b_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn, story-rich art style that brings a vibrant underworld to life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An expansive world with rich story settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juicy loot-dropping chaos for a treasure-hunting thrill</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Switch To Ranged Gun<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754160/extras/23f9b1d21faa8864d6981d592c1dfd5b.poster.avif?t=1752432147\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754160/extras/23f9b1d21faa8864d6981d592c1dfd5b.webm?t=1752432147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754160/extras/23f9b1d21faa8864d6981d592c1dfd5b.mp4?t=1752432147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Forge Your Weapon <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754160/extras/bfea52fa6b152d7ab8491a5f5bb16be0.poster.avif?t=1752432147\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754160/extras/bfea52fa6b152d7ab8491a5f5bb16be0.webm?t=1752432147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754160/extras/bfea52fa6b152d7ab8491a5f5bb16be0.mp4?t=1752432147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Notice of localization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since I only speak two languages, localization work will be done after the game is fully developed depend on my budget at that time. I plan to support as many languages as possible, but as this is a game made by me alone, with limited time and effort, all demos will use English uniformly. Thank you for your understanding\u00a0\u00a0\u0295\u0e07\u2022\u1d25\u2022\u0294\u0e07</p>",
